{"_v":1,"id":"memphis-2009","cat":"broadway","cs":77.45,"rc":9,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":93,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/711412924/","d":"2009-10-20","q":"\"Memphis\" is not just Broadway's news."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Stage","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/memphis"},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":77,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB125782678542851645","d":"2009-11-12","q":"Memphis is a show with a heart as big as all outdoors and the good sense not to wear it on its sleeve."},{"cn":"Peter Marks","o":"The Washington Post","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/wp-dyn/content/article/2009/10/18/AR2009101802476.html","d":"2009-10-19","q":"The musical has an old-fashioned, earnest quality that grows on you, and the cast attacks the material with infectious enthusiasm."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"Variety","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2009/legit/reviews/memphis-3-1200476779/","d":"2009-10-20","q":"The show is entertaining but synthetic, its telepic plotting restitching familiar threads from “Hairspray” and “Dreamgirls,” while covering fictitious ground adjacent to that of recent biopic “Cadillac Records.”"},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":49,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2009/10/20/theater/reviews/20memphis.html","d":"2009-10-19","q":"This slick but formulaic entertainment, written by David Bryan and Joe DiPietro, barely generates enough heat to warp a vinyl record, despite the vigorous efforts of a talented, hard-charging cast."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":96,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/memphis/","d":"2011-03-03","q":"The emergence of rock ’n roll set against an integrated love story makes for a first rate tale told with emotionally gripping force."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":84,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/434391973/","d":"2009-10-20","q":"Eventually finds its own voice and beat, and wins you over with its sheer enthusiasm and exuberant performances."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"http://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/Memphis.html","d":"2009-10-20","q":"Memphis is a show that wants to have it both ways: to be both a serious examination of racial tensions in the 1950s South and a feel-good musical that sends audiences home humming."}],"au":{"score":83.11,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":72,"c":133,"sr":3.6},"ss":{"s":89,"c":251}}},"tn":[{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Musical","n":null,"w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Book of a Musical","n":"Joe DiPietro","w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Joe DiPietro","w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"David Bryan","w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Orchestrations","n":"Daryl Waters","w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Orchestrations","n":"David Bryan","w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":null,"w":true},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Actor in a Musical","n":"Chad Kimball"},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Actress in a Musical","n":"Montego Glover"},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Direction of a Musical","n":"Christopher Ashley"},{"yr":64,"cat":"Best Costume Design of a Musical","n":"Paul Tazewell"}],"cn":{"t":"Critics find this energetic 1950s-set musical about race and rock 'n' roll crowd-pleasing but predictable, praising its talented cast, stirring vocals, and infectious enthusiasm while noting its old-fashioned, familiar storytelling.","rc":8},"bo":{"tw":null,"at":{"g":104453830,"p":1195,"a":1380731}},"ta":"225 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","vs":{"sl":4,"so":4,"co":3,"am":4,"fa":3},"pd":"2009-09-23","ca":[{"n":"Montego Glover","r":"Felicia"},{"n":"Chad Kimball","r":"Huey"},{"n":"Jennifer Allen","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Derrick Baskin","r":"Gator"},{"n":"Brad Bass","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Tracee Beazer","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"J. Bernard Calloway","r":"Delray"},{"n":"Kevin Covert","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Hillary Elk","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Bryan Fenkart","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Dionne Figgins","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Rhett G. George","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"James Monroe Iglehart","r":"Bobby"},{"n":"John Jellison","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Michael McGrath","r":"Mr. Simmons"},{"n":"Cass Morgan","r":"Mama"},{"n":"Vivian Nixon","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"John Eric Parker","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"LaQuet Sharnell","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Ephraim M. Sykes","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Cary Tedder","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Danny Tidwell","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Daniel J. Watts","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Katie Webber","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Charlie Williams","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Dan'yelle Williamson","r":"Ensemble"}]}